se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nSunny, Da Peng, and Bald Qiang are all hosts on the same channel. They often appear in the same program, but they rarely interact in private. One day, after the program recording ends, Da Peng sees Sunny preparing to leave, and he quickly goes over to talk to her. At this moment, Bald Qiang also comes over. Da Peng sees Bald Qiang, smiles, and says to Sunny, \"I have another matter to deal with, I leave first.\" Then he turns and leaves. Sunny watches Da Peng's retreating figure, her face turns slightly red.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Da Peng choose to leave after seeing Bald Qiang?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Da Peng does not want Bald Qiang to know what he says to Sunny.\nB. Da Peng does not like Sunny, he just politely goes over to say hello.\nC. Da Peng really has another matter to deal with.\nD. Da Peng is a relatively introverted person, he does not like to interact with others.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003593458805611984,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e254d6006945d2802275","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368084704,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"27bf5565e12e4bcd845177f9209c876b"}